Fixes the microphone taking the headset anyway when tap-to-talk is on.

The check that was supposed to defer it tested something that is not yet true at
the moment a connection is made, so the listening state could never be entered.
Music should now stay at full quality until you tap.

Taps themselves are still being tracked down. If one does nothing, please open
Diagnostics and read the Motion rows out — the rate, and which rejection
counter is moving. That says which half is at fault.
